msgstr "Фрагмент пройден. ИГРАТЬ СНОВА — новый забег."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Title note under CONTINUE (388 px, 15 px).
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#: scripts/main.gd:1134
msgid "Saved checkpoint could not be read."
msgstr "Не удалось прочитать сохранение."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Title note under CONTINUE (388 px, 15 px). SAFE POINT is the plate's word, УКРЫТИЕ (shelter). Shortened to fit the 388 px row: the game saves from the first УКРЫТИЕ ran 8 px over.
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#: scripts/main.gd:1134
msgid "No checkpoint yet. Saving starts at the first SAFE POINT."
msgstr "Сохранений нет. Первое сохранение — в УКРЫТИИ."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Changelog button text when the browser cannot open (338 px).
