# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#: scripts/main.gd:1178
msgid "The changelog text is missing from this build. Open the full changelog online."
msgstr "В этой сборке нет текста списка изменений. Открой полный список на сайте."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Opens the in-game changelog in every language but English: the changelog itself is not translated.
#: scripts/main.gd:1181
msgid "These development updates are written in English only."
msgstr "Список изменений доступен только на английском."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, when the hidden name key gives the engineer another of their three names; %s is the full name.
#. i18n: speaker=WOLF engineer=name
#: scripts/main.gd:1470
#, c-format
msgid "%s. That name sounds like you."
msgstr "%s. Это имя тебе подходит."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Credits heading (19 px, centred).
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#. TRANSLATORS: Heading over the AI disclosure in the credits, in the same capitals as the other headings.
#: scripts/main.gd:2036
msgid "AI DISCLOSURE"
msgstr "ОБ ИСПОЛЬЗОВАНИИ ИИ"

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Credits paragraph (582 px, 19 px, wraps). Translated word for word.
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#. TRANSLATORS: The AI disclosure Nathanial Henniges approved word for word (October 19, 2026). Translate it faithfully and in full; do not shorten, soften or add to it. Keep WOLF OVERRIDE, Nathanial Henniges and MrDemonWolf, Inc. as written.
#: scripts/main.gd:2038
msgid "WOLF OVERRIDE is a solo project by Nathanial Henniges (MrDemonWolf, Inc.). AI tools were used with careful human oversight to support the creative process for art and code. The story, characters and game design are his, and every AI-assisted asset is reviewed, edited and credited."
msgstr "WOLF OVERRIDE — сольный проект Nathanial Henniges (MrDemonWolf, Inc.). Инструменты ИИ применялись под тщательным контролем человека, чтобы поддержать творческий процесс в работе над графикой и кодом. Сюжет, персонажи и геймдизайн принадлежат ему, а каждый ресурс, созданный с помощью ИИ, проверяется, редактируется и указывается в титрах."

