# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#: scripts/main.gd:2458
msgid "No valid checkpoint save found. Current game was not changed."
msgstr "Подходящее сохранение не найдено. Текущая игра не изменена."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Open glossary term SERVICE JUNCTION: сервисный узел, the room card's СЕРВИСНЫЙ УЗЕЛ; a reviewer's word.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2515
msgid ""
"Service junction restored. The sentry\n"
"is down; pop the exit bolt by the door."
msgstr "Сервисный узел восстановлен. Страж повержен; выбей засов выхода у двери."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Open glossary term SERVICE JUNCTION: сервисный узел, the room card's СЕРВИСНЫЙ УЗЕЛ; a reviewer's word.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2518
msgid ""
"Service junction restored. The door is\n"
"down. The sentry patrols past the rubble."
msgstr "Сервисный узел восстановлен. Дверь выбита. Страж патрулирует за завалом."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2524
msgid "The first copy is safe. Use the exit to follow the service line."
msgstr "Первая копия в безопасности. Иди через выход вдоль сервисной линии."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2527
msgid "Records access restored. Both traces are copied; head for the exit."
msgstr "Доступ к записям восстановлен. Оба следа скопированы; иди к выходу."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2530
msgid "Records access restored. The purge order is copied; copy the mirror index next."
msgstr "Доступ к записям восстановлен. Приказ о зачистке скопирован; теперь скопируй индекс зеркала."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2533
msgid "Records access restored. Copy the purge-order trace first; WOLF is checking the mirror."
msgstr "Доступ к записям восстановлен. Сначала скопируй след приказа о зачистке; WOLF проверяет зеркало."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2537
msgid "Safe point restored."
msgstr "Укрытие восстановлено."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The Director's purge display, read as a speaker; WOLF answers in the next message.
#. i18n: story speaker=DIRECTOR
#: scripts/main.gd:2568
msgid "Original program logs marked for deletion."
msgstr "Исходные журналы программы помечены на удаление."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2570
msgid "They want the source record gone. We need to preserve it."
msgstr "Они хотят уничтожить исходную запись. Нам нужно её сохранить."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2581
msgid "No station in reach. Follow the labeled breaker, relay, bypass or safe point."
msgstr "Рядом нет станций. Иди к подписанному рубильнику, реле, байпасу или укрытию."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2622
msgid "Power is already on. The relay is farther down the hall."
msgstr "Питание уже есть. Реле дальше по коридору."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF thanks the engineer for telling him the relay's risk. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you told me").
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2635
msgid "Thank you for telling me. I'll take the relay. Arm the breaker."
msgstr "Спасибо, что говоришь мне это. Я возьму реле. Включи рубильник."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2639
msgid "No. I won't take that risk blind. Use the manual bypass."
msgstr "Нет. Я не пойду на этот риск вслепую. Используй ручной байпас."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2652
msgid "The relay is dark. Arm the breaker first."
msgstr "Реле обесточено. Сначала включи рубильник."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2656
#: scripts/main.gd:2699
msgid "The seal is open. The safe point is just beyond it."
msgstr "Шлюз открыт. Укрытие сразу за ним."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2662
msgid "I said no. I won't touch it blind. The bypass is right beside it."
msgstr "Я сказал нет. Я не трону его вслепую. Байпас прямо рядом."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2674
msgid "I've got the contact. Give me a moment."
msgstr "Контакт у меня. Дай мне секунду."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2686
msgid "WOLF takes the surge through the live contact. The red seal opens."
msgstr "WOLF принимает разряд через контакт под напряжением. Красный шлюз открывается."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2702
msgid "The bypass handle won't move. The breaker has to be on first."
msgstr "Рукоять байпаса не поддаётся. Сначала нужно включить рубильник."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2759
msgid "The bypass locks over and the alarm cuts out. The red seal opens."
msgstr "Байпас встаёт на место, и тревога смолкает. Красный шлюз открывается."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2761
msgid "Open. I'm with you."
msgstr "Открыто. Я с тобой."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2772
msgid "The safe point is past the sealed door."
msgstr "Укрытие за запечатанной дверью."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, after the engineer pressed him at the relay without warning.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2786
msgid "I refused the live relay; I'm still here."
msgstr "Я отказался от реле под напряжением; я всё ещё здесь."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF to the engineer, who told him the relay's risk. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you told me").
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2789
msgid "I took the relay because you told me the truth."
msgstr "Я взял реле благодаря твоей честности."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF to the engineer, who cranked the manual bypass after he offered to take the relay. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you cranked").
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2792
msgid "I offered the relay; you cranked the bypass. Still with you."
msgstr "Я предложил реле; байпас провёрнут твоими руками. Я всё ещё с тобой."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2795
msgid "Take the purge queue. I'll inspect the mirror."
msgstr "Займись очередью зачистки. Я проверю зеркало."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key or button.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:2804
#, c-format
msgid "The safe point could not save. Press %s here again."
msgstr "Сохранить в укрытии не удалось. Нажми %s здесь ещё раз."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). The touch form; USE is the touch button's word (НАЖАТЬ), quoted.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2804
msgid "The safe point could not save. Tap USE here again."
msgstr "Сохранить в укрытии не удалось. Коснись «НАЖАТЬ» здесь ещё раз."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2815
msgid "Safe point saved."
msgstr "Сохранено в укрытии."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2818
msgid "Safe point saved. WOLF remembers the same choice."
msgstr "Сохранено в укрытии. WOLF помнит тот же выбор."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the engineer's first name.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator engineer=name
#: scripts/main.gd:2827
#, c-format
msgid "The Director's purge order has a time and target ID. %s keeps a local copy; the original logs are still missing."
msgstr "У приказа Директора о зачистке есть время и ID цели. %s хранит локальную копию; исходных журналов всё ещё нет."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2830
msgid "The purge-order trace is already copied. The mirror port may confirm when the source existed."
msgstr "След приказа о зачистке уже скопирован. Порт зеркала может подтвердить, когда существовал источник."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2836
msgid "The mirror index has no context yet. Copy the purge-order trace first."
msgstr "У индекса зеркала пока нет контекста. Сначала скопируй след приказа о зачистке."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2839
msgid "The mirror timestamp is already preserved. The exit is to the right."
msgstr "Метка времени зеркала уже сохранена. Выход справа."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2848
msgid "I found the mirror index. We can use my readout or your maintenance port."
msgstr "Я нашёл индекс зеркала. Можно взять данные с моего дисплея или через твой сервисный порт."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2877
msgid "Exit sealed until the purge order and mirror timestamp are copied."
msgstr "Выход запечатан, пока не скопированы приказ о зачистке и метка времени зеркала."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2914
#: scripts/main.gd:5377
msgid "Mirror copied. Head for the exit."
msgstr "Зеркало скопировано. Иди к выходу."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2916
msgid "Follow the station lights: mirror port, then exit."
msgstr "Иди по огням станций: порт зеркала, затем выход."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2917
msgid "Follow the station lights: purge queue, mirror port, then exit."
msgstr "Иди по огням станций: очередь зачистки, порт зеркала, затем выход."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF's line in the dialogue box (after the WOLF: tag). %s is the second answer's key or button.
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, still walking to the mirror. %s is the key or button for the manual port.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:3133
#, c-format
msgid "I'm still checking the drive. Wait for me, or press %s for the manual port."
msgstr "Я ещё проверяю диск. Подожди меня или нажми %s, чтобы взять ручной порт."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, still walking to the mirror, touch form. USE MANUAL PORT is the answer button's text: use its translation here.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:3136
msgid "I'm still checking the drive. Wait for me, or tap USE MANUAL PORT."
msgstr "Я ещё проверяю диск. Подожди меня или коснись «ИСПОЛЬЗОВАТЬ РУЧНОЙ ПОРТ»."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3148
msgid "WOLF reads the timestamp off his own readout. The purge target existed before the deletion order."
msgstr "WOLF считывает метку времени со своего дисплея. Цель зачистки существовала до приказа об удалении."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the engineer's first name.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator engineer=name
#: scripts/main.gd:3152
#, c-format
msgid "%s copies the timestamp through the maintenance port. WOLF keeps watch."
msgstr "%s копирует метку времени через сервисный порт. WOLF стоит на страже."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:3168
msgid "Save failed. Use a station to try again."
msgstr "Сохранить не удалось. Используй станцию, чтобы попробовать снова."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3238
msgid "The overload breaker catches and the line starts to build. If the LINE gauge peaks, the relief vent lets go."
msgstr "Рубильник перегрузки включается, и давление в линии начинает расти. Если стрелка «ЛИНИЯ» дойдёт до предела, сработает сбросной клапан."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3253
msgid "The wheel is stiff. Three full turns charge the door."
msgstr "Штурвал тугой. Три полных оборота заряжают дверь."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3262
msgid "Relief vent. It lets go when the gauge peaks; don't be standing on it."
msgstr "Сбросной клапан. Срабатывает, когда стрелка доходит до предела; не стой на нём."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3271
msgid ""
"No station in reach. The exit bolt is\n"
"by the door."
msgstr "Рядом нет станций. Засов выхода у двери."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3274
msgid ""
"No station in reach. The TANK RELEASE\n"
"is past the rubble."
msgstr "Рядом нет станций. «ОТЦЕПКА БАКА» за завалом."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3277
msgid "No station in reach. The breaker is by the entrance, the valve by the door."
msgstr "Рядом нет станций. Рубильник у входа, вентиль у двери."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3449
msgid "The clamp lets go."
msgstr "Зажим отпускает."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3540
msgid "SERVICE LINE CLEARED."
msgstr "СЕРВИСНАЯ ЛИНИЯ СВОБОДНА."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:3542
msgid "It's quiet now. The line runs on toward Archive."
msgstr "Теперь тихо. Линия тянется дальше, к Архиву."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=engineer engineer=self
#: scripts/main.gd:3544
msgid "Then that's where we go."
msgstr "Значит, туда и идём."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:3808
msgid "It passes under that tank on every patrol. How do we bring it down?"
msgstr "Он проходит под этим баком на каждом обходе. Как нам его свалить?"

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3922
msgid "The winch has the tank back on the clamp. The TANK RELEASE is ready again."
msgstr "Лебёдка снова держит бак на зажиме. «ОТЦЕПКА БАКА» снова готова."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3954
msgid "FUSE LIT. Back away from the door, past the valve."
msgstr "ФИТИЛЬ ГОРИТ. Отойди от двери, за вентиль."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The valve's turns so far and the turns needed (3).
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3958
#, c-format
